            "type": "number",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "FADER\nThe Fader node takes a texture input and multiplies all channels with the gain parameter.\nThis effectively allows you to fade one texture in and out.\n\n- Patch Explained -\n\n• The Sine modulates the gain of the Fader, fading the triangle in and out.\n"
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
